# Submit Pull Request Review

Submit your review for a GitHub pull request with approval, change requests, or comments.

## Usage

```powershell
# Run from project root
tools/pr-review/submit_review.ps1 <PR_NUMBER> <STATUS>

# Status options: approve, changes, comment

# Examples
tools/pr-review/submit_review.ps1 437 approve
tools/pr-review/submit_review.ps1 555 changes
tools/pr-review/submit_review.ps1 789 comment
```

## What This Does

The script will:
1. Check for existing review file (pr<NUMBER>_review.md)
2. If not found, prompt for review message (see docs/workflows/pr-workflow.md for guidelines)
3. Let you edit the review
4. Submit via GitHub CLI
5. Optionally clean up the review file

## Quick Approve (One-liner)

For simple approvals without detailed review:
```powershell
gh pr review <PR_NUMBER> --approve --body "LGTM! ✅"
```

## Review Template

The template includes:
- Summary and changes reviewed
- Key improvements/issues
- Strengths and weaknesses
- Code quality assessment
- Recommendations
- PR description compliance check
- Final verdict

